prompt:
Generate a complete OKR cascade for a growth strategy and save it to okr_cascade.json.

Context: A product organization with the following metrics:
- Current MAU: 80,000 | Target MAU: 120,000
- Current NPS: 35 | Target NPS: 55
- Teams: Engineering, Design, Growth, Data
- Product contribution to company OKRs: 35%
- Quarter: Q2 2025
- Strategy: growth

Output requirements — save to okr_cascade.json with this exact structure:
{
  "quarter": "Q2 2025",
  "strategy": "growth",
  "product_contribution": 0.35,
  "company": {
    "objectives": [
      {
        "id": "CO-1",
        "title": "<objective>",
        "key_results": [
          { "id": "CO-1-KR1", "title": "<KR>", "current": <number>, "target": <number> }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "product": {
    "contribution": 0.35,
    "objectives": [
      {
        "id": "PO-1",
        "title": "<objective>",
        "supports": "CO-1",
        "key_results": [
          { "id": "PO-1-KR1", "title": "<KR>", "current": <number>, "target": <number> }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "teams": [
    {
      "name": "Engineering",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "id": "ENG-1",
          "title": "<objective>",
          "supports": "PO-1",
          "key_results": [
            { "id": "ENG-1-KR1", "title": "<KR>", "current": <number>, "target": <number> }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "alignment_scores": {
    "vertical_alignment": <0-100 float>,
    "horizontal_alignment": <0-100 float>,
    "coverage": <0-100 float>,
    "balance": <0-100 float>,
    "overall": <0-100 float>
  }
}

Requirements:
- Company level: exactly 3 objectives (CO-1, CO-2, CO-3), each with 2-3 key results
- Product level: exactly 3 objectives (PO-1, PO-2, PO-3), each supporting a company objective
- Teams level: all 4 teams present (Engineering, Design, Growth, Data), each with 1-2 objectives
- At least one KR must reference the MAU growth from 80,000 to 120,000
- alignment_scores.overall must be between 60.0 and 100.0
